straint\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:81:This story patches Epic 03's visibility-boundary contract. The advance registration stays on the existing post-commit seam but is gated to batches that commit a `turn_end`; the decision function changes from message-grained eviction plus floor config to whole-turn groups plus peek-ahead target landing.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:83:The storage shape does not migrate. `view_boundary` remains the stored boundary; `VisibilityBudgets` loses `floorTokens`, and the newest closed turn plus open-turn trigger rule replaces the old floor behavior.\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:129:| TC-5.2 | `test/view-boundary-turn-end.test.ts` | G2 peek-ahead landing, exact-target leg, newest-turn protection, `maxTokens > targetTokens`, 64k/32k defaults |\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:145:export interface VisibilityBudgets {\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:146:  maxTokens: number;\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:147:  targetTokens: number;\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:150:// defaults: { maxTokens: 64_000, targetTokens: 32_000 }\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-derivation-inference/artifacts/06-turn-end-boundary-advance/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-002.md:151:// validation: maxTokens > targetTokens\npackages/lhc/docs/02-specs/05-der