urnless singleton), TC-5.2 (golden G2 under 64k/32k defaults, exact-target ≥ leg, oversized-newest protection, max ≤ target TypeError, defaults), TC-5.3 (replay determinism + forward-only)\\\" },\\n    { \\\"path\\\": \\\"packages/lhc/test/view-boundary.test.ts\\\", \\\"reason\\\": \\\"Amendment ledger applied: per-intake legs re-cut for turn grouping, old TC-4.3 floor legs superseded (note left pointing at TC-5.2), construction tests moved to two-field budgets plus the floorTokens-rejected leg, TC-4.6 heal re-cut to multi-turn batches, seam-direction-two re-cut to the 64k/32k defaults; status zoneTokens assertions kept (shared-query invariant)\\\" },\\n    { \\\"path\\\": \\\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/boundary-g1-trajectory.json\\\", \\\"reason\\\": \\\"G1 re-cut for turn grouping and turn-end trigger: 6 batches covering under-max closes, whole-turn eviction with peek-ahead, no-move close, mid-turn over-max hold, and the healing close that evicts three groups\\\" },\\n    { \\\"path\\\": \\\"packages/lhc/test/view-select-golden.test.ts\\\", \\\"reason\\\": \\\"BoundaryGolden budgets type reduced to two fields; G1 comments updated to the turn-end contract (replay-equality leg unchanged)\\\" },\\n    { \\\"path\\\": \\\"packages/lhc/test/goldens/README.md\\\", \\\"reason\\\": \\\"boundary-g1-trajectory row updated to describe the re-cut rule set\\\" },\\n    { \\\"path\\\": \\\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/view-boundary.ts\\\", \\\"reason\\\": \\\"New boundary fixture: boundaryTokens/boundaryToolRun/turnedToolResultEvents/seedTurnedToolResults — scripted closed/open/turnless turns seeded through real intake commits\\\" },\\n    { \\\"path\\\": \\\"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/index.ts\\\", \\\"reason\\\": \\\"Re-export the new boundary fixture helpers\\\" },\\n    { \\\"path\\\": \\\"packages/lhc/test/view-fixture.test.ts\\\", \\\"reason\\\": \\\"Construction legs: target<floor leg replaced by floorTokens-unknown rejection; defaults assertion updated to 64000/32000\\\" }