 >= 60) and stops at the newest closed turn t5 (80, never a candidate); position = t4's result (order 21)\",\n      \"resultTokens\": [],\n      \"turnEnd\": true,\n      \"expectedPosition\": 21,\n      \"expectedZoneTokens\": 80\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
